The Qt libraries are dynamic libraries, so a modified Qt 4.8 of the same ABI can replace them and applications keep working.
The packages are installed through the Catalogue, one SIS each ("Qt"; "QtMobility" once released); no Phorepoc image
carries them. Each SIS installs LICENSE.LGPL and the source offer (SOURCE-OFFER.txt in this repository is the same text) in
\resource\<package>\.

